Original project:
https://github.com/aidreamy/morpheus

Third-party components used by the `speak-phonemize` build variant:
- piper-phonemize (https://github.com/csukuangfj/piper-phonemize), GPL-3.0-or-later (due to espeak-ng)
- espeak-ng (https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng), GPL-3.0-or-later

Note: the older rhasspy/piper-phonemize repository is archived and deprecated;
the Rust crate used here (piper-phonemize-sys 1.5.9) pulls its prebuilt
libraries and espeak-ng-data from the csukuangfj/piper-phonemize releases.

These components are only linked into builds produced with
`--features speak-phonemize`. Their respective copyright and license terms
apply to those builds.
